# Prod HTTP-redirect snippet — imported by config/Caddyfile when
# ANTHIVE_HTTP_REDIRECT_SNIPPET points at this file (done by
# ant-supervisor when ANTHIVE_PROD=1).
#
# Intentionally empty: on prod, Caddy itself listens on :8500 to
# receive plain HTTP from nginx (which is the TLS terminator on :443).
# A separate HTTP-redirect block on :8500 would collide with the main
# listener, so we omit it entirely.
#
# The file MUST exist (Caddy errors out on a missing import target).
